  (text "BeatPad - schematic transcribed from the two-page Tinkercad PDF (26 Oct 2026).\nNet labels retain the PDF names where legible. Switch inputs are D2-D8; the order was traced from the labeled rails.\nLCD: VCC=UNO 5V; SDA=A4; SCL=A5; GND=BATPOWER_SOURCE-.\nPower: 6V battery positive to UNO VIN; battery negative to common ground; UNO 5V feeds LCD.\nBuzzer is shown on D9 and ground. Four 220 ohm LED branches use D11/D12 and ground.\nIndicator ambiguity: the red DPOWERLED appears between A0 and ground and no series resistor is shown; preserved as drawn.\nThe four discrete LED output pairings are transcribed from the visible D11/D12 rails; confirm channel-to-colour mapping against the original Tinkercad design before fabrication.\nThis is a schematic transcription, not a PCB, and no ERC/DRC or electrical safety sign-off is implied." (at 20 164 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "665ebc5c-f08b-4454-aeaf-5bf9c8513b1c"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
